{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.28","index":28,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.28.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"yú","traditional":"愚","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hǎo","traditional":"好","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zì","traditional":"自","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yòng","traditional":"用","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"贱","pinyin":"jiàn","traditional":"賤","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hǎo","traditional":"好","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zì","traditional":"自","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"专","pinyin":"zhuān","traditional":"專","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"shēng","traditional":"生","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jīn","traditional":"今","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"世","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"fǎn","traditional":"反","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gǔ","traditional":"古","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"rú","traditional":"如","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"cǐ","traditional":"此","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"灾","pinyin":"zāi","traditional":"災","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jí","traditional":"及","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shēn","traditional":"身","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Nabi bersabda, \"Orang bodoh tetapi suka memakai cara sendiri, berkedudukan rendah suka menonjolkan diri, hidup pada jaman ini tetapi ingin menjalankan peraturan-peraturan kuno (yang sudah lapuk); perbuatan semacam ini niscaya membawa malapetaka baginya.\""},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.28.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"fēi","traditional":"非","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"议","pinyin":"yì","traditional":"議","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"礼","pinyin":"lǐ","traditional":"禮","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"制","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dù","traditional":"度","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kǎo","traditional":"考","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wén","traditional":"文","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Kalau bukan seorang raja, tidak berwenang menetapkan Tata Susila, tidak berwenang menetapkan Ukuran dan tidak berwenang menetapkan Kesatuan huruf."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.28.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"jīn","traditional":"今","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"车","pinyin":"chē","traditional":"車","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tóng","traditional":"同","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"轨","pinyin":"guǐ","traditional":"軌","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"书","pinyin":"shū","traditional":"書","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tóng","traditional":"同","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wén","traditional":"文","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tóng","traditional":"同","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"伦","pinyin":"lún","traditional":"倫","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Pada saat ini di dunia tiap kereta sama rodanya, tiap kitab sama hurufnya dan tiap adat sama pelaksanaannya."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.28.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"虽","pinyin":"suī","traditional":"雖","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"位","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"gǒu","traditional":"苟","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gǎn","traditional":"敢","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zuò","traditional":"作","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"礼","pinyin":"lǐ","traditional":"禮","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"乐","pinyin":"lè","traditional":"樂","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"虽","pinyin":"suī","traditional":"雖","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"gǒu","traditional":"苟","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"位","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"亦","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gǎn","traditional":"敢","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zuò","traditional":"作","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"礼","pinyin":"lǐ","traditional":"禮","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"乐","pinyin":"lè","traditional":"樂","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Meskipun berkedudukan bila tidak ber-Kebajikan tak berani membuat Tata Susila dan Musik. Sekalipun ber-Kebajikan bila tidak berkedudukan, tidak berani pula membuat Tata Susila dan Musik."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.28.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"wú","traditional":"吾","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"说","pinyin":"shuō","traditional":"說","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"夏","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"礼","pinyin":"lǐ","traditional":"禮","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"qǐ","traditional":"杞","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zú","traditional":"足","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"征","pinyin":"zhǐ","traditional":"徵","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"wú","traditional":"吾","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"学","pinyin":"xué","traditional":"學","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yīn","traditional":"殷","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"礼","pinyin":"lǐ","traditional":"禮","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sòng","traditional":"宋","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"cún","traditional":"存","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"wú","traditional":"吾","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"学","pinyin":"xué","traditional":"學","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhōu","traditional":"周","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"礼","pinyin":"lǐ","traditional":"禮","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"jīn","traditional":"今","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yòng","traditional":"用","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"wú","traditional":"吾","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"从","pinyin":"cóng","traditional":"從","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhōu","traditional":"周","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Nabi bersabda, \"Aku dapat membicarakan Kesusilaan Kerajaan He, tetapi Negara Ki tidak cukup memberi kenyataannya. Lalu Kupelajari Kesusilaan Kerajaan Ien; ternyata Negeri Song masih dapat memeliharanya. Akhirnya Kupelajari Kesusilaan Kerajaan Zhou - Ciu yang saat ini masih dijalankan. Maka Aku mengikuti Kerajaan Zhou - Ciu.\" (S.S. III:9, 14)."}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/28 - Bab XXVII - Menetapi Kedudukan.md","title":"Bab XXVII — Menetapi Kedudukan"}
